From 7fe047ffeee6d3182f8cfab2827a9293600cbb15 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daryl Denson <9751141+denson9874@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:36:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Evolver: name ExpressiveOS in the logo, boot animation and
 keybox options

ExpressiveOS is its own ROM: the status bar logo and boot animation
pickers listed its own logo and animations as Evolution X's, and the
keybox options named Evolution X. The keybox download summary no longer
names whose servers it comes from, so its translations go. The Arabic
boot animation names go too, as they no longer lined up with the
animations, and so does the Kurdish title of the logo setting, which
read "Evolution X logo" where English says "Logo".

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
